<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Anchor and Image Tag Example</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>
  <p>Click the image below to visit Google:</p>
  <a href="https://www.google.com" target="_blank">
    <img src="https://www.google.com/images/branding/googlelogo/2x/googlelogo_color_272x92dp.png"
         alt="Google Logo"
         width="200"
         height="80">
  </a>
  <p>Above image is clickable. It will take you to Google website.</p>
  <p>Visit my <a href="https://www.youtube.com" target="_blank">YouTube Channel</a></p>
  <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/JavaScript-logo.png"
       alt="JavaScript Logo"
       width="150"
       height="150">
  <footer>
    <p>Created by Majid Papa © 2025</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
